What was the soil temperature, measured in degrees Celsius, on Thursday?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(8.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/4,2/8,3/12,4/16,5/20,6/24} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \foreach \x/\lab in {1/Mon,2.4/Tue,3.8/Wed,5.2/Thu,6.6/Fri} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\draw[thick] (1,3)--(2.4,5)--(3.8,4)--(5.2,6)--(6.6,2); \foreach \p in {(1,3),(2.4,5),(3.8,4),(5.2,6),(6.6,2)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);} \node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,3) {Temperature}; \node[below] at (3.8,-1.0) {Day}; \node at (3.8,7.1) {Soil temperature};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

During which interval did the reading stay unchanged?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(8.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \foreach \x/\lab in {1/0,2.4/1,3.8/2,5.2/3,6.6/4} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {$\lab$};}
\draw[thick] (1,2)--(2.4,4)--(3.8,4)--(5.2,5)--(6.6,3); \foreach \p in {(1,2),(2.4,4),(3.8,4),(5.2,5),(6.6,3)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);} \node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Reading}; \node[below] at (3.8,-1.0) {Time (minutes)}; \node at (3.8,6.1) {Sensor readings};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

How much did the snow depth change from Day $2$ to Day $5$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.8]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,7.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(8.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/3,2/6,3/9,4/12,5/15,6/18} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \foreach \x/\lab in {1/D1,2.4/D2,3.8/D3,5.2/D4,6.6/D5} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\draw[thick] (1,2)--(2.4,5)--(3.8,4)--(5.2,6)--(6.6,3); \foreach \p in {(1,2),(2.4,5),(3.8,4),(5.2,6),(6.6,3)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);} \node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,3) {Depth (cm)}; \node[below] at (3.8,-1.0) {Day}; \node at (3.8,7.1) {Snow depth};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows a cyclist's distance from home. During which interval was the cyclist travelling fastest?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw[step=1,gray!30] (0,0) grid (5,6);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(5.5,0);
\foreach \y/\lab in {0/0,1/5,2/10,3/15,4/20,5/25,6/30} {\node[left] at (0,\y) {$\lab$};}
\foreach \x/\lab in {0/9am,1/10am,2/11am,3/12pm,4/1pm,5/2pm} {\node[rotate=60,anchor=east,inner sep=2pt] at (\x,-0.15) {\lab};}
\draw[thick] (0,0)--(1,3)--(2,3)--(4,6)--(5,0);
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.2,3) {Distance from home (km)}; \node[below] at (2.5,-1.5) {Time};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
